SUMMARY:Let's Walk!!🚶Loantaka Brook
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\n**PLEASE READ THE DESCRIPTION**\n\nLet's explore
  the Loantaka Brook Reservation.\nWe will meet at the parking lot off Loan
 taka Way\, walk 45 minutes along a paved trail\, then return to our starti
 ng point. This is a 90-minute out-and-back walk at a social pace. We will 
 likely walk 3.5-4 miles depending on the pace of the whole group.\n\nPleas
 e bring water and wear shoes appropriate for the trail. The reserve is not
  very shaded\, so I'd recommend a hat/sun protection.\n\n**Please try to a
 rrive about 5 minutes early so we can start on time.**\n\nDisclaimer: If y
 ou join us for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for you
 r own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case
  of injury or mishap.
